      "en": "Blessed are those who dwell in your house. They are always praising you. Selah.",
      "ko": "주의 집에 거하는 자가 복이 있나이다 저희가 항상 주를 찬송하리이다(셀라)",
      "source_text_hash": "66e03327a30bc9ef32f17ac44826fee9037be0808032f300cbd4592ad4b92926",
      "translation_text_hash": "e09c073a9d7672f8c8dd5efd9e00eba7d98123550fd0e5486c8ea7501fb6ebd6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
