      "en": "For a day in your courts is better than a thousand. I would rather be a doorkeeper in the house of my God, than to dwell in the tents of wickedness.",
      "ko": "주의 궁정에서 한 날이 다른 곳에서 천날보다 나은즉 악인의 장막에 거함보다 내 하나님 문지기로 있는 것이 좋사오니",
      "source_text_hash": "1b2ee27f411f0f86d5737af50b4daf7cd476fdb2db0a9cd0c23987f405a83daf",
      "translation_text_hash": "54745749717661283b9751265bea35d22438a3f980602685d4c396098a1f258b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
